  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In northern plains, Fang Yuan as Wolf King Chang Shan Yin retreats when a warning rises around a shark fin wolf. Tu Bo dies on the spot, and Fang Yuan names the attack as soul explosion. A rank three Gu Master who flees with him then dies in mid-air. Bian Si Xuan later says he avoided most of the force of soul explosion.",
        "chapters": [
          504
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_chang_shan_yin",
          "char_tu_bo",
          "sys_gu_master",
          "char_bian_si_xuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Dong Fang Yu Liang marks a wild shark fin wolf, plants a rank five soul explosion Gu inside it, and gives Bian Si Xuan the Gu needed to activate the soul explosion. When Fang Yuan orders someone else to strike the wolf, she activates soul explosion Gu. The power is formless and colorless. Fang Yuan reaches the furthest range, uses a reinforcement as a shield, and blocks most of the strength.",
        "chapters": [
          505
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "trap-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_dong_fang_yu_liang"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Sun Shi Han tells Hei Lou Lan that Dong Fang Yu Liang assassinated Wolf King Chang Shan Yin, that the Wolf King was affected by soul explosion Gu but did not die, and proposes holding the Wolf King back while they tear down Dong Fang Yu Liang’s methods in battle.",
        "chapters": [
          506
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "alliance-talk",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_sun_shi_han",
          "char_hei_lou_lan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan had a thousand man soul. Injuries from the soul explosion dropped him to eight hundred man soul, and after days of recuperation he recovers to nine hundred man soul.",
        "chapters": [
          511
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "soul-injury",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
